## elaborations.soar -- selection-world: 1 compare.

## Preference for default select reject conflict.
sp {selection-world*compare*default*select*reject*conflict
   "Reject an object if it leads to a conflict that can not be resolved."
   :default
   (state <s3> ^attribute state
               ^choices none
               ^superstate <s2>
               ^quiescence t)
   (<s2> ^impasse conflict
         ^superstate <state1>
         ^item <operator>
         ^quiescence t)
   (<state1> ^operator <operator> +)
-->
   (<state1> ^operator <operator> -)}
